            {
                "comment": "A good professor, put effort into every class &amp; generally cares if we learn the material. Has unrealistic standards, goes over a topic quickly, asks a question, then gets frustrated at the class bc no one has mastered the topic 1 min after seeing it. The homework and exam questions are like long stories that was annoying. But overall still good",
